The first add beside a plan seeds `corrections.md` with its H1, writes entry `R1` with the
stubbed heading time and a link to the artefact, and prints `{sidecar}#R1` alone. With no session
id the dialogue is not linked and a warning goes to stderr.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
macro_stubs:
  "core.macros.date +%Y-%m-%d %H:%M": "2026-10-15 15:40"
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/p/index.md --
---
title: P
---

# P
-- cmd --
booping correction add --target plans/p/index.md --step groom/draft-plan --did "proposed one plan over the 35 SP threshold" --said "split it, corrections first" --why "too big to review"
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
plans/p/corrections.md#R1
-- stderr --
warning: no session id; dialogue not linked
-- expected/cwd/vault/plans/p/corrections.md --
# Corrections

## R1 — groom/draft-plan — 2026-10-15 15:40

**Did:** proposed one plan over the 35 SP threshold

**Said:**

> split it, corrections first

**Why:** too big to review

**Dialogue:** not found — no session id

**Artifact:** [index.md](index.md)
